{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/310-riverside-crescent-sobha-hartland","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":310,"crm_id":"2366","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Oceanscape","slug":"oceanscape-damac-properties-al-reem-island","display_address":"Al Reem Island","building_type":["apartment","townhouse"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":493500,"display_price":"493K","lattitude":24.5076401,"longitude":54.4030402,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Oceanscape is a mixed-use development on Al Reem Island in Abu Dhabi consisting of two 35-storey twin towers. The developer of the project is DAMAC Properties.</p><p>Oceanscape features not only <strong>1-3 bedroom</strong> flats, but also townhouses and commercial spaces. All townhouses have a private pool, outdoor garden, several bathrooms and dressing rooms, as well as a large balcony overlooking the canal.</p><p>The complex is located on an exotic island, surrounded by lush mangroves on one side and an extensive waterfront on the other.</p><p>On-site amenities include an infinity pool overlooking the picturesque mangroves and the Arabian Gulf, gym, steam room and sauna, massage rooms, landscaped gardens, children's playroom, audio-visual entertainment centre and a shaded children's playground.</p><p>Concierge services are available to residents, and customised smart home technology will provide residents with added comfort. The reception area has a lobby and guest lounge for business meetings or gathering with friends, each building has multiple high-speed lifts, CCTV cameras and physical security to ensure the safety of residents. Covered car parking is located in the basement and the three floors of the podium house retail space and boutiques.</p><p>Oceanscape is located close to Abu Dhabi's major highways, allowing for easy access to the city centre within 15 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2366/images/2024/06/27/3PrPTlzJ0pcKAk3476AeqSE5Jgy8AYnoknCWdxiI.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/27/3PrPTlzJ0pcKAk3476AeqSE5Jgy8AYnoknCWdxiI.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2366/images/2024/06/27/g0npssZwBdZo3mmtP8UM8usoLzbuFuiz7MxrtBhO.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/27/g0npssZwBdZo3mmtP8UM8usoLzbuFuiz7MxrtBhO.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2366/images/2024/06/27/y76C0mO0lozhpBRn1vW6VhtyEh0tfCOFFlrs0z7j.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/27/y76C0mO0lozhpBRn1vW6VhtyEh0tfCOFFlrs0z7j.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2692,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/27/hsSLw6Sf73MGV3ow3K1RhV7bKfOepDW7CHtfs7Zw.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":null,"floor_plans":[{"id":2471,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2472,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2473,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"TBA ","payment_plans":[],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[],"bitrix":{"id":953,"pf_id":"are.3.5558","source":null,"project_id":"Shams Abu Dhabi","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Oceanscape","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"DAM